  "summary": "每枚硬币最多使用一次，求从零开始能连续构造多少个整数金额。",
  "insight": "若当前已能构造 [0,reachable]，下一枚 coin<=reachable+1 时新区间扩展到 reachable+coin；否则 reachable+1 永远无法构造。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "答案包含金额零",
    "硬币需升序处理",
    "返回连续金额数量 reachable+1"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "reachable-prefix-greedy",
      "title": "可达前缀贪心",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "维护无空洞可构造金额区间右端点。",
      "steps": [
        "coins 排序，reachable=0",
        "若 coin>reachable+1 则停止",
        "否则 reachable+=coin，返回 reachable+1"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n log n)",
        "space": "O(log n)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/reachable-prefix-greedy/Solution.java",
